\par }{\b\i\insrsid12532697\charrsid2316872 Ripresa de}{\b\i\insrsid12532697 gli}{\b\i\insrsid12532697\charrsid2316872  esp}{\b\i\insrsid12532697 ropri}{\insrsid12532697 
